WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.258
With i18n-tasks, CI finds
missing and unused keys,

2
00:00:05.258 --> 00:00:07.173
and translate-missing
fills the gaps.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.241
It does those checks well,

4
00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:12.816
with plural-aware reports and
exit codes that fail a build.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.145
General Translation
translates whole locale files,

6
00:00:17.145 --> 00:00:18.827
with your Glossary and review.

7
00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:23.470
Run npx gt translate in CI,

8
00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.722
and it writes every target locale.

9
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:29.470
Later runs retranslate the
entries whose English changed.

10
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:35.212
Many teams use both, with the
i18n-tasks checks after translation

11
00:00:35.212 --> 00:00:36.198
in the same job.

12
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.459
Your team now ships
Portuguese with each release.
